            <div class="table table-rwd table-primary">
                <div class="thead">
                    <div class="tr">
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">返水 2.5% (货币)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">最低支出</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">最高支出</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">投注倍数</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tbody">
                    <div class="tr row-even">
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">马币 (MYR)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">MYR 5</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">MYR 888</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">1x</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tbody">
                    <div class="tr row-even">
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">印尼盾 (IDR)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">IDR 15,000</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">IDR 2,888,000</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">1x</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tbody">
                    <div class="tr row-even">
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">泰铢 (THB)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">THB 50</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">THB 6,888</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="td-date">
                            <span class="text">1x</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>


            </div>
            <br><br>

            <span class="promotions-title">优惠标准规则</span>
            <ol type="1">
                <li>促销适用于所有Nova88会员。<br><br></li>
                <li>除非另有说明，否则从此次促销中返水金额在汇入的三十（30）天内有效。参加会员在指定的时间内未能达到要求的条件，所有返水金额使用的赢利将被撤销。<br><br></li>
                <li>玩家串关投注额达到最低支出将会获得串关 2.5% 返水。<br><br></li>
                <li>参与优惠会员必须接受并遵守上述所有条款以及Nova88实施的所有相关规则和规定。<br><br></li>
                <li>Nova88有权随时中止或取消本优惠。<br><br></li>
                <li>Nova88保留对本优惠的最终解释权。<br><br></li>
                <li>Nova88<a class="text-link" href="https://www.nova88asia.com/SiteSkin/Nova88/Static/@lang/Promotion.html" target="_blank">标准规则和条款</a>适用。</li>
